# Routes for hooks/skill-route.sh. Copy to ~/.claude/skill-routes (private, per machine) and edit.
# One route per line: <extended regex, case-insensitive><TAB><skill name>. First match wins; only
# prompts of up to 40 characters are routed; a skill that is not installed is skipped.
#
# Work machine (skills that live there):
#(^|[[:space:]])PR[[:space:]]*(올려|만들어|열어)	ship-pr
#티켓[[:space:]]*(따|만들|파)	ticket
#(worktree|워크트리|서버)[[:space:]]*정리	cleanup
#
# Any machine:
#(교차|크로스)[[:space:]]*리뷰|cross-?review	cross-review
#(열린|밀린)[[:space:]]*(거|것|루프)	loops
#(갭|미비한|남은)[[:space:]]*(감사|작업|부분)	audit
